{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221230","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322123001:1":{"text":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322123001":{"text":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322123002:1":{"text":"我明白了。很抱歉，让你们为我做了这么多事情……","source_cn":"我明白了。很抱歉，让你们为我做了这么多事情……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D71381609CACF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322123003:1":{"text":"其实我知道，依照现在的情形，白山的民众不可能彻底信任我们。","source_cn":"其实我知道，依照现在的情形，白山的民众不可能彻底信任我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1A37F1225A0AF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322123004:1":{"text":"哪怕教会认可活死人的身份，哪怕人人都知道他们曾是光荣的战士，只要活死人依然会攻击民众，人们就依旧会因此而恐慌。","source_cn":"哪怕教会认可活死人的身份，哪怕人人都知道他们曾是光荣的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847A7A7392EA2853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322123005:1":{"text":"到最后，人们还是会害怕我们，远离我们，甚至还会质疑教会的用心。","source_cn":"到最后，人们还是会害怕我们，远离我们，甚至还会质疑教会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05F55D3492BFD7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322123006:1":{"text":"我……不想让事情变成这样。","source_cn":"我……不想让事情变成这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2121C0D9D0002662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322123007:1":{"text":"看来还是得找到让活死人不再攻击人类的方法才行……","source_cn":"看来还是得找到让活死人不再攻击人类的方法才行……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E29977B0B65C8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322123008:1":{"text":"是的。这个问题我反复思考了很久，我认为想要让他们彻底安息，还是需要和圣堂的人合作。","source_cn":"是的。这个问题我反复思考了很久，我认为想要让他们彻底安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B0A805B1BF7F119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322123009:1":{"text":"咦？为什么？","source_cn":"咦？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA8E7BF8077E07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322123010:1":{"text":"圣光对亡灵有着很强的净化作用。虽然在我们这样的亡灵身上表现得不算明显，但对失去了理智只凭本能行事